  Birdsong comparison, stated as a comparison and not a claim: Derégnaucourt
  et al. (2005) found deterioration across sleep in juvenile zebra finches
  and that the birds which deteriorated MORE imitated BETTER. Nothing here
  measures eventual imitation, so this run cannot speak to that half.
